error[branch-mismatch] 4:51-4:52
  (def sent (if failed (call mail.send {:to "ops"}) 0))
                                                    ^
  The branches return different types: Unit and Int.
  Every branch of an if or match must return the same type. To call a tool only when a test holds, write (when test (call ...)), which is (some result) or none.
